      <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold">Clinical decision support for cardiovascular risk assessment.</h1>
      <p class="lead mb-4">CardioMind combines federated learning, explainable ensemble models, and secure REST services to help teams deliver personalized care without centralizing sensitive patient data.</p>
      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
